(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF MICRO, SMALL AND MEDIUM ENTERPRISES) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: CREDIT GUARANTEE FUND TRUST FOR MICRO AND SMALL ENTERPRISES \(CGTMSE\) / SIDBI / CGTMSE TRUST / MLIS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Collateral-free credit facility for micro and small enterprises with) Tj
T*
(guarantee coverage up to Rs. 5 Crore backed by SIDBI and Ministry of MSME.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. New and existing Micro and Small Enterprises \(Manufacturing and) Tj
T*
(   Services\).) Tj
T*
(2. Retail trade enterprises up to Rs. 2 Crore exposure.) Tj
T*
(3. Educational institutions and training centers.) Tj
T*
(4. No third-party guarantee or collateral required.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Guarantee coverage up to 85% for loans up to Rs. 5 Lakh \(Micro\), 75% to 85%) Tj
T*
(   for loans up to Rs. 500 Lakh. Up to 85% coverage for women-owned) Tj
T*
(   enterprises and units in NER.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 85.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 5.00 Crore per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Udyam Registration Certificate) Tj
T*
(2. GST Registration Certificate) Tj
T*
(3. PAN Card and KYC of Promoters) Tj
T*
(4. Projected Balance Sheets & Cash Flow Statement) Tj
T*
(5. Bank Account Statement for 12 months) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Apply via Member Lending Banks or Jan Samarth Portal) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://www.jansamarth.in/business-activity-loan-schemes) Tj
